Package: StationSWERegressionV2
Title: Real-Time Snow Water Equivalent Estimation by Regressing Station Data on Physiographic and Remote Sensing Predictors
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kehan", "Yang", , "32207757+KehanGit@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0319-4739")),
    person("Dominik", "Schneider", role = "aut",
           comment = "Author of the original stationsweRegression package"))
Description: Daily gridded snow water equivalent (SWE) from an elastic-net linear regression of snow
    pillow SWE on physiographic variables, a historical SWE pattern from snow reanalysis, and MODIS
    fractional snow-covered area. Extends Schneider and Molotch (2016) <doi:10.1002/2016WR019067>;
    used in Yang et al. (2022) <doi:10.1016/j.advwatres.2021.104075>.
